# Frontend
- Mobile-first; big tap targets; plain words; icons next to every status (check / cross / ?).
- Tiers: Ready, Likely (needs info), One step away, Not now, Watchlist. No "% match".
- Every scheme card: tier badge, "criteria met X of Y (Z unknown)", benefit buckets,
  status + last-verified badge, official link, Why? / Why not? buttons.
- Headline: "Up to X in subsidies (estimated) + Y collateral-free credit options".
- Indian number format via a single formatINR() helper.
- All strings through i18n (en, kn, hi) from M7 on.
- Footer disclaimer: "Information only. Not affiliated with the Government of India.
  Final decisions are made by the implementing agency."
- No government logos or emblems. Loading, empty and error states on every page.
